SUMMARY:Spring Migrants Bird Walk
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a chill Spring Migrants Bird Walk and spot cool birds as they start their season! Get ready to explore the great outdoors and spot some amazing feathered friends on our Spring Migrants Bird Walk. This is an awesome chance to see a variety of birds as they make their way during migration season. Whether you’re a seasoned birder or just curious\, come enjoy fresh air\, beautiful sights\, and great company. Bring your binoculars and a sense of adventure! This is an all ages\, all levels bird walk. \nCOST: FREE \nCANCELLATION: NJ Audubon’s programs require a minimum number of registrants to run. If we cancel\, due to lack of participation\, severe weather\, or unforeseen circumstances\, all participants will be notified as soon as possible and are eligible for a full refund. Participants may cancel without penalty if greater than 48 hours in advance. Sorry\, no refund for cancellations less than 48 hours in advance unless due to health emergencies; however\, registrations can be transferred to another program in the future. \nREGISTER HERE
URL:https://njaudubon.org/event/spring-migrants-bird-walk/
LOCATION:Lorrimer Sanctuary\, 790 Ewing Avenue\, Franklin Lakes\, NJ\, 07417\, United States
CATEGORIES:Lorrimer Sanctuary,Nature Walk
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://njaudubon.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/Spring-Migrants-Bird-Walk-2026.jpg
